### Common Issues & Fixes

#### Issue: Horizontal Scroll
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG: Content overflows
<div className="w-[2000px]">  {/* Fixed width too wide */}
  {/* Content */}
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT: Responsive width
